msgid "<span>Session 1</span><span>practice: <code>01-intro-syntax-types/</code> in the homework repository</span>"
msgstr "<span>Занятие 1</span><span>упражнения: <code>01-intro-syntax-types/</code> в homework repository</span>"

#. html
#: site/lectures/01-intro-syntax-types.md:9
