#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-intro-syntax-types.md:574
msgid "In the terminal, `cls` (cmd) or `clear` clears the screen. All shortcuts: [keyboard reference sheets](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editing/getting-started/tips-and-tricks#_keyboard-reference-sheets)."
