msgid "All commands: the Command Palette - `Ctrl+Shift+P` in VS Code, `Ctrl+Shift+C` in JupyterLab. All shortcuts: **Help > Show Keyboard Shortcuts** (JupyterLab)."
msgstr "Всички команди: Command Palette - `Ctrl+Shift+P` във VS Code, `Ctrl+Shift+C` в JupyterLab. Всички клавишни комбинации: **Help > Show Keyboard Shortcuts** (JupyterLab)."

#. heading 3
#: site/lectures/01-intro-syntax-types.md:738
msgid "Magic commands"
msgstr "Магически команди (magics)"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-intro-syntax-types.md:740
msgid "Lines that start with `%` (one line) or `%%` (the whole cell) are commands of the notebook, not Python ([IPython magics](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html)):"
msgstr "Редовете, които започват с `%` (един ред) или `%%` (цялата клетка), са команди на notebook-а, а не Python ([IPython magics](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html)):"

