#~ msgid "Always open the **folder** of a project, not single files: **File > Open Folder**, or right-click the folder in Windows Explorer > **Open with Code**. The folder is your **workspace**: VS Code remembers the open files, and you can keep settings for this folder only in `.vscode/settings.json` (`Ctrl+Shift+P` > **Preferences: Open Workspace Settings**). Read more: [What is a VS Code workspace?](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/workspaces)"
#~ msgstr "Винаги отваряйте **папката** на проекта, а не отделни файлове: **File > Open Folder** или десен клик върху папката в Windows Explorer > **Open with Code**. Папката е вашето **работно пространство** (workspace): VS Code помни отворените файлове и можете да държите настройки само за тази папка в `.vscode/settings.json` (`Ctrl+Shift+P` > **Preferences: Open Workspace Settings**). Още за четене: [What is a VS Code workspace?](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/workspaces)"

